WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.400
Bird needed a plan to save her party.

2
00:00:11.401 --> 00:00:16.343
She flew back to the pond.

3
00:00:16.344 --> 00:00:26.611
Meanwhile Kip mixed cupcake batter.

4
00:00:26.612 --> 00:00:34.645
He poured it into a pan.

5
00:00:34.646 --> 00:00:38.429
He put the pan in the oven.

6
00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:53.869
"Okay," said Kip. "Now I need party games."

7
00:00:53.870 --> 00:01:00.840
Kip looked all over.

8
00:01:00.841 --> 00:01:03.703
But he couldn't find any party games.

9
00:01:03.704 --> 00:01:07.249
"Hmm," said Kip.

10
00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:11.248
"I also need decorations."

11
00:01:11.249 --> 00:01:21.437
Kip looked all over.

12
00:01:21.438 --> 00:01:25.672
But he couldn't find any decorations.

13
00:01:25.673 --> 00:01:30.575
Just then he smelled something.

14
00:01:30.576 --> 00:01:45.063
It smelled like . . .

15
00:01:45.064 --> 00:01:49.399
"Burnt cupcakes!"

16
00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:53.314
"Oh well," said Kip.

17
00:01:53.315 --> 00:01:56.762
"My party will still be fun.

18
00:01:56.763 --> 00:02:06.757
At least my friends will be there."

19
00:02:06.758 --> 00:02:14.607
Kip went to the giant rock.

20
00:02:14.608 --> 00:02:18.566
But nobody was there.

21
00:02:18.567 --> 00:02:21.435
"Oh no!" cried Kip.

22
00:02:21.436 --> 00:02:26.300
"I forgot to invite everyone!"

23
00:02:26.301 --> 00:02:31.720
"My party has no cupcakes," said Kip.

24
00:02:31.721 --> 00:02:38.128
"It has no party games. It has no decorations.

25
00:02:38.129 --> 00:02:44.423
And it has no friends!"

